<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Dorbyl sees tough trading outlook.</title>
<headline>Dorbyl sees tough trading outlook.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Engineering group Dorbyl Ltd said on Monday that trading conditions were expected to be difficult for the next six to nine months but the company looked forward to economic growth improving in the first quarter of 1998.  </p>
<p>The group also said it planned to expand aggressively, both organically and through acquisitions, in the year ahead.</p>
</text>
